                 "view":  {
                              "value":  "\u003ch3 local-id=\"3bb44feecdfd\" id=\"AddRPSinvoicedatecalculationlogicinmanualinvoice,debitnoteandovertimeonetime/periodicalcontractlevelinvoices-Userstory\"\u003eUser story\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4060d2192138\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/wiki/spaces/Phoenix/pages/953581569/Change+in+invoice+payment+deadline+date+calculation+for+RPS+PODs\" data-linked-resource-id=\"953581569\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\"\u003eChange in invoice payment deadline date calculation for RPS PODs\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"ab95557c89b8\" /\u003e\u003ch3 local-id=\"225d182692a6\" id=\"AddRPSinvoicedatecalculationlogicinmanualinvoice,debitnoteandovertimeonetime/periodicalcontractlevelinvoices-Acceptancecriteria\"\u003eAcceptance criteria\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"a6af2de5ca0a\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"80fba3f36c2c\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"a603166c18f2\"\u003eFor manual invoices and debit notes  PODs should be checked in detailed data\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"39b7a9978e5d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c2cb237fbb57\"\u003eFor over time one time/over time periodical billings with level contract, PODs should be checked in contract\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"cac84e7e9043\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"251561be3070\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"820319ac8d1e\"\u003eIf invoice has detailed data, invoice due date is according to contract and in the invoice there is RPS POD\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"021ca0b6f509\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"db8e01fee636\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"691f9579c6e8\"\u003einvoice payment deadline should be calculated from RPS nomenclature\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"b6bf0cf8-b390-4bdc-b02b-e55312d3f26b\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"38e413fb-e19a-4d8c-bafe-47eb86be96b9\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"5e74961f5b7f\"\u003e For example, if the nomenclature indicates 5, and the invoice date is 7 May, the due date will be 5 June   \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"ac04f5ba-167c-4ab0-ba07-6f6e0ba4140b\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"dd8fc4847c54\"\u003eThe system should use the default calendar to determine working and non-working days.\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"16716e88-a8a2-4c3b-9fc7-2ce9ec1b07c7\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"27a7eb89-09b6-4325-b3d6-8bac59a80d61\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"cf53c3a26121\"\u003eIf the calculated due date falls on a non-working day, it will be adjusted to the nearest working day.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"6bbf4b3c-326f-4c1d-94fb-2c1b51a76aba\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"2dce67b00336\"\u003eIf there is no default calendar, return error on specific invoice\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"2227bd1d-6b15-4c00-96b7-31007b728e6e\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"524bfc9f-f5b0-4d19-927f-af11c0e3c4cf\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"8123f1409b89\"\u003eerror message: âBilling run cannot be started. The run includes PODs with RPS, and a default calendar is required to calculate invoice payment deadlines for these PODsâ\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"c36dd79e-8ebc-41dd-b977-8cee3b9e670f\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4d582edce0fa\"\u003e if there are two different RPS numbers linked, billing run should return error: \u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"e9895017-2892-491a-9e2c-73a600b2842d\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"649dcab7-1bf8-480f-bbc3-0432cf65615d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"16902f34c96f\"\u003eEven if assigned RPS numbers have the same dates  in nomenclature, it still should return error\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"055544ab-dc55-4542-a83a-491232950381\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"aa849b229f4b\"\u003eIf there are two PODs one with RPS and the other without it, the billing run should calculate due date using RPS number in nomenclature \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"bf39a26e5fcf\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"40a0086d1305\"\u003eIf invoice doesnât have detailed data, payment deadline will be calculated based on existing logic\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e",
